Bureau from village price collection. They are used to revise minimum wages and for rural cost-of-living analysis.^Inflation is the year-on-year percentage change in the all-India general index."},{"question":"Why are there two bases?","answer":"The Labour Bureau moved from base 1986-87=100 to base 2019=100 with data from mid-2025. The old series ends in March 2025 and the new begins in June 2025; the levels (hundreds vs. ~145) are not comparable, and the page does not splice them."},{"question":"Caveats?","answer":"The new-base series is short (since June 2025); the latest month is provisional. The old series carries financial-year labels in the source; months were mapped to calendar dates (April-December to the first year, January-March to the second)."}],"related":[],"layer":"added","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T07:09:48+00:00"}